---
pagination:
  data: agents
  size: 1
  alias: agent
permalink: "/agents/{{ agent.id }}/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ agent.name }}"
  category: "Personas · {{ agent.name }}"
  lede: "{{ agent.role }}"
  updated: "{{ agent.updated }}"
layout: page
section: personas
---

{% if agent.image %}
<figure class="agent-portrait">
  <img src="{{ agent.image | url }}" alt="{{ agent.imageAlt | escape }}" width="{{ agent.imageWidth }}" height="{{ agent.imageHeight }}" decoding="async">
</figure>
{% endif %}

<h2 id="who">{{ agent.heading }} <a class="heading-anchor" href="#who" aria-label="Permalink to {{ agent.heading }}">#</a></h2>

{% for paragraph in agent.paragraphs %}
<p>{{ paragraph }}</p>
{% endfor %}

<p class="agent-ask"><strong>Ask about:</strong> {{ agent.consult }}</p>

<h2 id="words">In their own words <a class="heading-anchor" href="#words" aria-label="Permalink to In their own words">#</a></h2>

<p class="muted">Every line below passes <code>verify --exact</code> against the archive.</p>

{% for sample in agent.samples %}
<figure class="agent-quote">
  <blockquote><p>{{ sample.text | escape }}</p></blockquote>
  <figcaption>{{ agent.name }}, {{ sample.context | escape }}</figcaption>
</figure>
{% endfor %}

<h2 id="limits">What they won't do <a class="heading-anchor" href="#limits" aria-label="Permalink to What they won't do">#</a></h2>

<ul>
  {% for limit in agent.limits %}
  <li>{{ limit | escape }}</li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>

<h2 id="setup">Eyes up <a class="heading-anchor" href="#setup" aria-label="Permalink to Eyes up">#</a></h2>

<p>Clone the persona, then let its setup script link the Grimoire and get the
database:</p>

<pre><code>git clone {{ agent.repo }}.git
cd {{ agent.repoName }}
./setup.sh</code></pre>

<p>Use <code>BOOTSTRAP=1 ./setup.sh</code> to download the release database
without a prompt. For OpenCode or OpenClaw, use the shared sync instead:
<a href="{{ '/agents/install/' | url }}">Deploy the Agents</a>.</p>

<h2 id="for-experts">For experts <a class="heading-anchor" href="#for-experts" aria-label="Permalink to For experts">#</a></h2>

<p class="muted">The release record, entry file, audit and repository links.</p>

<h3 id="record">The record <a class="heading-anchor" href="#record" aria-label="Permalink to The record">#</a></h3>

<dl class="agent-record">
  <dt>Version</dt>
  <dd><a href="{{ agent.releaseUrl }}">{{ agent.version }}</a></dd>
  <dt>Audit</dt>
  <dd>{{ agent.audit.passed }}/{{ agent.audit.total }} suites</dd>
  <dt>Updated</dt>
  <dd><time datetime="{{ agent.updated }}">{{ agent.updated }}</time></dd>
</dl>

<h3 id="entry-file">The brain <a class="heading-anchor" href="#entry-file" aria-label="Permalink to The brain">#</a></h3>

<p>In OpenCode, <code>{{ agent.entry }}</code> is the main agent entry. A generic
runtime that reads <code>AGENTS.md</code> can use the repository directly. The
file is where the voice, guardrails and canon pointers begin.</p>

<p><a href="{{ agent.entryUrl or agent.repo }}">Read {{ agent.entry }} on GitHub</a>.</p>

<p>Series deployment also installs a read-only consult copy,
<code>{{ agent.id }}-consult.md</code>, so another agent can ask a question without
getting write access to this one's files.</p>

<h3 id="checks">The audit <a class="heading-anchor" href="#checks" aria-label="Permalink to The audit">#</a></h3>

<pre><code>bash tests/master-audit.sh</code></pre>

<p>{{ agent.audit.passed }}/{{ agent.audit.total }} suites pass on the current
release. The audit checks voice, quotes, module coverage, the conversation path
and the shared structure gates. It is the same suite CI runs.</p>

<h3 id="repository">The source <a class="heading-anchor" href="#repository" aria-label="Permalink to The source">#</a></h3>

<ul>
  <li><a href="{{ agent.repo }}">{{ agent.repoName }}</a></li>
  <li><a href="{{ agent.repo }}/blob/master/README.md">README</a></li>
  <li><a href="{{ agent.repo }}/issues">Issues</a></li>
</ul>

<h2 id="next">Next <a class="heading-anchor" href="#next" aria-label="Permalink to Next">#</a></h2>

<ul>
  <li><a href="{{ '/agents/' | url }}">Back to the series</a></li>
  {% for other in agents %}{% if other.id != agent.id %}
  <li><a href="{{ ('/agents/' + other.id + '/') | url }}">Meet {{ other.name }}</a></li>
  {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  <li><a href="{{ '/agents/build/' | url }}">Add another agent</a></li>
  <li><a href="{{ '/agents/install/' | url }}">Deploy into OpenCode or OpenClaw</a></li>
  <li><a href="{{ '/agents/platforms/' | url }}">Integrations</a></li>
</ul>
